      {
         "id": "SECTION_introduction",
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "### Introdução\n\nAo estudarmos números em diferentes sistemas numéricos em diferentes continentes (Ásia, América - *Abya Yala* e África), observamos que a humanidade criou diferentes símbolos para representar a contagem, e que estes símbolos eram diferente do alphabeto que usamos no nosso dia a dia.\n\nAgora, veja os números romanos adaptados dos povos estruscos na tabela à seguir comparado com outros sistemas decimais (<htcite0>):",
               "source": [
                  {
                     "type": 0,
                     "uuid": "7be50fd2-2ce2-4d2d-b123-22d6bae50e23",
                     "text": "Keyser, P.",
                     "page": "pp. 544",
                     "date_time": {
                        "type": "gregory",
                        "year": "2026",
                        "month": "08",
                        "day": "28"
                     }
                  },
                  {
                     "type": 0,
                     "uuid": "c6f861ac-7b52-4dd4-8e64-e5fb5bc87ad5",
                     "text": "Gregersen, E. (2026, July 27)",
                     "page": "Números romanos",
                     "date_time": {
                        "type": "gregory",
                        "year": "2026",
                        "month": "08",
                        "day": "28"
                     }
                  }
               ],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "<p><table id=\"sequenceNum\" class=\"tableTen tableTenBgBlue\"><tr><th>Sistema numérico</th><th  colspan=\"7\">Números</th></tr> <tr><td>Etrusco-Romano</td><td style=\"background-color: white;\">I</td><td style=\"background-color: white;\">V</td><td style=\"background-color: white;\">X</td><td style=\"background-color: white;\">L</td><td style=\"background-color: white;\">C</td><td style=\"background-color: white;\">D</td><td style=\"background-color: white;\">M</td> </tr>  <tr><td>Indo-Arábico</td><td style=\"background-color: white;\">1</td><td style=\"background-color: white;\">5</td><td style=\"background-color: white;\">10</td><td style=\"background-color: white;\">50</td><td style=\"background-color: white;\">100</td><td style=\"background-color: white;\">500</td><td style=\"background-color: white;\">1000</td> </tr> <tr><td rowspan=\"3\">Vigesimal Mesoamericano</td><td  rowspan=\"3\" style=\"background-color: white; vertical-align: bottom;\"><img id=\"idt1\" onclick=\"htImageZoom('idt1, '0%')\" src=\"images/HistoryTracers/Maya_1.png\" /></td><td rowspan=\"3\" style=\"background-color: white; vertical-align: bottom;\"><img id=\"idt5\" onclick=\"htImageZoom('idt5, '0%')\" src=\"images/HistoryTracers/Maya_5.png\" /></td><td rowspan=\"3\" style=\"background-color: white; vertical-align: bottom;\"><img id=\"idt10\" onclick=\"htImageZoom('idt10, '0%')\" src=\"images/HistoryTracers/Maya_10.png\" /></td><td style=\"background-color: white; vertical-align: bottom;\" rowspan=\"2\"><img id=\"idt250\" onclick=\"htImageZoom('idt250, '0%')\" src=\"images/HistoryTracers/Maya_2.png\" /></td><td style=\"background-color: white; vertical-align: bottom;\" rowspan=\"2\"><img id=\"idt5100\" onclick=\"htImageZoom('idt5100, '0%')\" src=\"images/HistoryTracers/Maya_5.png\" /></td><td style=\"background-color: white; border-bottom: none;\"><img id=\"idt1500\" onclick=\"htImageZoom('idt1500, '0%')\" src=\"images/HistoryTracers/Maya_1.png\" /></td><td style=\"background-color: white; border-bottom: none;\"><img id=\"idt21000\" onclick=\"htImageZoom('idt21000, '0%')\" src=\"images/HistoryTracers/Maya_2.png\" /></td></tr>            <tr style=\"background-color: white;\"><td><img id=\"idt1050\" onclick=\"htImageZoom('idt1050, '0%')\" src=\"images/HistoryTracers/Maya_5.png\" /> </td><td><img id=\"idt0100\" onclick=\"htImageZoom('idt0100, '0%')\" src=\"images/HistoryTracers/Maya_10.png\" /> </td></tr> <tr style=\"background-color: white;\"><td><img id=\"idt1050\" onclick=\"htImageZoom('idt1050, '0%')\" src=\"images/HistoryTracers/Maya_10.png\" /></td><td><img id=\"idt01000\" onclick=\"htImageZoom('idt01000, '0%')\" src=\"images/HistoryTracers/Maya_0.png\" /></td><td><img id=\"idt0500\" onclick=\"htImageZoom('idt0500, '0%')\" src=\"images/HistoryTracers/Maya_0.png\" /></td><td><img id=\"idt01000\" onclick=\"htImageZoom('idt01000, '0%')\" src=\"images/HistoryTracers/Maya_0.png\" /></td></tr></table> </p>",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "html",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "<p class=\"desc\"><b>Tabela 1</b>: Comparação de números etrusco-romanos com números de outros sitemas numéricos.</p>",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "html",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "<p><center><div class=\"first_steps_reflection_parent\"><div class=\"first_steps_reflection question_mark\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-brain\"></i></div><div class=\"first_steps_reflection\"><b>Reflexão 1: Isso me lembra...</b><br /><br />Observando os sistemas numéricos da &lt;b&gt;Tabela 1&lt;/b&gt;, o que te lembra os números etrusco-romanos?</div></div></center></p>",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "html",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
